                <div class="cs-item h-100">

                    <span class="flaticon-034-stationary-bike"></span>

                    <h4>
                        Modern Equipment
                    </h4>

                    <p>
                        Professional and modern equipment
                        to support your training.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>


            <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-6">

                <div class="cs-item h-100">

                    <span class="flaticon-033-juice"></span>

                    <h4>
                        Healthy Nutrition
                    </h4>

                    <p>
                        Nutrition plans and guidance
                        to support your fitness goals.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>


            <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-6">

                <div class="cs-item h-100">

                    <span class="flaticon-002-dumbell"></span>

                    <h4>
                        Professional Trainers
                    </h4>

                    <p>
                        Get support from coaches who
                        help you improve your performance.
                    </p>

                    <div class="mt-3">

                        <a asp-controller="Coach"
                           asp-action="Index"
                           class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm">

                            Meet Trainers

                        </a>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>


            <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 col-sm-6">

                <div class="cs-item h-100">

                    <span class="flaticon-014-heart-beat"></span>

                    <h4>
                        Health & Fitness
                    </h4>

                    <p>
                        Build a stronger and healthier
